# The Tebako Volume (book/): generated chapter bodies, colophon, compile
# outputs, and the shipped artifacts — rebuilt by `npm run book` on every
# docs publish; never committed. The compile runs with book/ as its cwd, so
# metanorma's log and the relaton cache land beside the entry point.
book/build/
book/dist/
book/book.asciidoc.log.txt
book/relaton/
